    <!--
        Every glyph the application draws, as bare path data.

        Geometries rather than an icon font: a font is one more file to ship, one more thing to
        license, and it renders at whatever weight the typeface decided. These are drawn on a 24x24
        grid and filled by the control that hosts them, so one Path style governs their size and
        their colour follows the text beside them through every state.
    -->

